  intro:'The bus family, four ways: the coach bus for long journeys, the yellow school bus for the morning run, the double-decker bus with its two floors of windows and the quiet electric bus that hums instead of roaring.',
  say:'Coach bus! School bus! Double-decker! Electric bus! The coach goes far away, the school bus brings us to school, the double-decker has TWO floors — climb the stairs! — and the electric bus goes shhh, no engine roar!',
